Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:16.80,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The rules keep changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:25.64,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:36.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:44.72,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I am resolved to sever this flood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:51.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:55.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}from loneliness and distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:01:00.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}One more step and you'll fall into madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:05.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Don't fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,150)}I look towards the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:11.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}Chase !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:14.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Refined to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:20.36,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Never retreat, no matter the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:23.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I dare to defy the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:27.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Always overcome the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:29.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ignite the seas with blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:34.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}bloom through trials and tribulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:38.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Even the sharpest thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:43.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}will be reduced into ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:47.56,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}What is there to fear ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:56.72,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:07.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Interesting !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.72,0:02:09.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,A mere mortal
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.68,0:02:13.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,was able to remain conscious under my Divine Sense ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.48,0:02:14.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:16.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.40,0:02:24.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,No wonder you didn't pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.84,0:02:26.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that's how it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:29.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:31.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,are not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.28,0:02:47.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,A top-grade puppet at the Illusory Yin realm !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:49.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to find
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.08,0:02:52.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,such a pleasant surprise on this trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:55.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once I search your soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.76,0:02:56.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will find
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:02:59.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,whoever made this puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:07.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.56,0:03:32.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.12,0:03:36.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,This man is definitely not a second-step cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.12,0:03:39.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,But why can't I see through his cultivation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.04,0:03:48.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Thunder Celestial Messenger...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:50.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:56.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Trying to run ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.37,0:04:00.92,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1665,467)}Wilderness\NPlanet Ran Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:09.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Leave this puppet behind
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.12,0:04:12.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I will spare the three of you !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.64,0:04:14.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm the one
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:17.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,who won't spare you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.96,0:04:19.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I arrived a second later,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.12,0:04:22.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,you would've already killed my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:25.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter who you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.24,0:04:27.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.52,0:04:28.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,die today !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.00,0:04:35.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,You overestimate yourself !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:37.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.60,0:04:39.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,you have a puppet by your side,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.60,0:04:42.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you think you can challenge a Thunder Celestial Messenger ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:49.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.52,0:05:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,This bit of thunder energy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.32,0:05:04.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,is too weak !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:11.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,A thunder spell ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.12,0:05:13.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.88,0:05:15.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're Xu Mu !?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.28,0:05:17.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,This
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:20.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,is true thunder !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.40,0:05:41.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:44.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,What the hell is your cultivation level !?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:48.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,My cultivation level...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:57.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:05:58.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,his domain ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:07.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,His energy is still rising ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.84,0:06:09.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such a powerful domain...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.52,0:06:12.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,This man is no ordinary cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:16.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,If his domain has already reached the second step,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:18.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll have trouble beating him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.12,0:06:22.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,My mind has been particularly agitated today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.36,0:06:24.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:26.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,will I understand today
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:30.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,why you didn't let me cultivate ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.28,0:06:33.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.72,0:06:36.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:49.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't even realize that my domain
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.80,0:06:51.96,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1670,471)}Life and Death Domain\NPeak Late stage Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:51.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,has reached Peak Late stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:55.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.80,0:06:57.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,his domain has not yet broken through the first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.68,0:07:00.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,If his domain were in the second step
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.40,0:07:01.92,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1660,482)\fad(300,300)}Wang Lin's avatar\NMiddle stage Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.16,0:07:02.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,along with the puppet,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.16,0:07:04.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,things wouldn't have ended well for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.12,0:07:10.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,With such a low cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.20,0:07:13.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,you dare to impersonate a Thunder Celestial Messenger !?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.36,0:07:15.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.56,0:07:17.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,show you what that title
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.08,0:07:19.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,really means !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:28.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Thunder Beast !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:33.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only by possessing such a Thunder Beast,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:36.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,can one be worthy of being called a Thunder Celestial Messenger !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.44,0:07:39.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because of your crime,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.24,0:07:42.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,your entire family shall be exterminated !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.20,0:07:46.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It hasn't even grown a horn
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:49.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you call that a Thunder Beast ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:13.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,A silver-horned Thunder Beast !?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.36,0:08:15.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's really a sacred beast !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.40,0:08:17.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even within the Thunder Celestial Temple,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.68,0:08:21.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,only core messengers possess silver-horned sacred beasts...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:24.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,For it to have fallen into the hands of a rogue cultivator like this
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.16,0:08:27.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,is such a waste !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:29.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I kill this man,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.16,0:08:31.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,this sacred beast will be mine !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.44,0:08:45.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thunder Celestial Tribulation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.80,0:08:46.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,fall !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:51.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,No thunder under the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.20,0:08:53.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,can harm me in the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:08:56.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This thunder
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.72,0:08:58.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,is no exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:08.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,This was a spell bestowed by the Thunder Celestial Temple !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.24,0:09:11.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did he break it so easily ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.12,0:09:35.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,A full power strike from a celestial artifact
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.76,0:09:37.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,still couldn't shake his foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.36,0:09:40.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,An Illusory Yin cultivator
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:43.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,is indeed formidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:45.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your comprehension of the Thunder Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:47.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,is indeed superior to mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.28,0:09:50.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,If our cultivations were equal,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:52.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would almost certainly have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.12,0:09:54.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a pity, what a pity...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.00,0:09:59.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the end, you're just an Ascendant cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.68,0:10:00.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't you know
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.04,0:10:03.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,that no matter how strong the spells of the first step are,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.52,0:10:05.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,they're just mere spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:08.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,While the origin energy of second step cultivators
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.56,0:10:10.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,touches the very essence of laws !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.84,0:10:15.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hand over the silver-horned Thunder Beast and the puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.56,0:10:17.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:19.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll use my origin energy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.92,0:10:21.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,to turn you all to ashes !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:28.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want to fight, then fight !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.56,0:10:33.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have very little origin energy left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.52,0:10:34.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I consume more,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.24,0:10:37.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll be even further away from Corporeal Yang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.56,0:10:41.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Given Xu Mu's talent,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:43.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,he willingly lived in seclusion
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.44,0:10:45.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,and gifted a puppet to protect his son ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.36,0:10:47.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why don't
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.32,0:10:48.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I find a flaw in his domain
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.24,0:10:50.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,and attack his heart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.68,0:10:54.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why are you so nervous ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.32,0:10:56.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just want to know
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:10:59.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,if this mortal is aware
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.16,0:11:02.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,that he is already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.32,0:11:04.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Silence !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.76,0:11:05.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The flaw in his domain
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:07.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,is indeed this mortal !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.16,0:11:11.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since his physical body no longer exists,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.08,0:11:13.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,why did you use a spell
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.60,0:11:16.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,to forcibly lock his soul here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:18.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shut up !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.72,0:11:24.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nice technique !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.24,0:11:26.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,But it won't stop me !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.48,0:11:28.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me see
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:31.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,the secrets of your heaven defying
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.44,0:11:33.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,soul binding spell !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:41.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.12,0:11:42.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.36,0:11:44.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nirvana Cleanser sword energy !?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.72,0:11:57.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,A madman...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:11:59.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's a complete madman !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.44,0:12:00.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,He used this kind of sword energy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.88,0:12:03.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,to form flesh for a mere soul fragment !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.16,0:12:06.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,If that sword energy had been aimed at me just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.32,0:12:14.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Die !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.12,0:12:19.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,An origin energy spell !?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.52,0:12:20.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,How...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:22.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can he use an origin energy spell !?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.96,0:12:26.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,You forced me to use my source origin energy !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:27.28,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1713,471)\fad(300,300)}Origin Energy\NThunder Cauldron
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.72,0:12:28.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Origin Energy Thunder Cauldron !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.28,0:13:03.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xu Mu,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.88,0:13:05.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,let us see which one of us will survive
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.40,0:13:07.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,between you and me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.20,0:13:09.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,in my Thunder Cauldron !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:11.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Refine !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.96,0:13:45.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is he doing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:47.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those runes...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.48,0:13:50.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,why am I scared of them ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.72,0:13:51.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,God Slaying Chariot,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.56,0:13:53.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,third seal,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.28,0:13:55.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,open !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.16,0:14:08.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Im...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.12,0:14:09.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Impossible !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.20,0:14:11.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,What kind of Thunder Beast is this !?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.08,0:14:46.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Heavenly...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.12,0:14:47.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Chop !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:49.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.44,0:14:50.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.80,0:15:14.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:16.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,is what he said
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.48,0:15:18.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,true ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.60,0:15:23.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I cultivate,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:26.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,my soul will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.84,0:15:27.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is that right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:31.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,My body
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.20,0:15:34.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,was formed from sword energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.92,0:15:35.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.76,0:15:38.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,have already died long ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.48,0:15:43.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.48,0:15:45.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.08,0:15:47.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,are who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.92,0:15:49.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:52.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,you once taught me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:54.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,to climb mountains when I encounter them,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:56.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,to cross the rivers when I encounter them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:15:59.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,That if the heavens and the earth are in the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.96,0:16:02.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must never give in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.36,0:16:05.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.40,0:16:09.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I already had the answer deep in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:12.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just didn't dare to face it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.48,0:16:16.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why can't I cultivate ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.72,0:16:19.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why can't I have children ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.04,0:16:21.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why have I never been ill
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.92,0:16:23.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,during those 70 years ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.40,0:16:26.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why have I
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.92,0:16:31.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,never truly felt tired in my life ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.04,0:16:36.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.00,0:16:39.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I understand everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.24,0:16:43.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,No wonder I always
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.44,0:16:45.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,dreamed during my childhood
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.72,0:16:48.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I was in a world of golden light.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.36,0:16:56.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Wang Ping,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.88,0:16:58.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,have no mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.72,0:17:00.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,But fortunately, in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:01.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I had you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.16,0:17:03.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Qing Yi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.72,0:17:05.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:08.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,you hid it from me for 70 years
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.04,0:17:12.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,just to give me a fulfilling life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.92,0:17:14.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:19.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,If there is a next life,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.92,0:17:21.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will come looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.92,0:17:26.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Ping...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.92,0:17:30.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.12,0:17:34.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't even have real tears to shed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.20,0:17:45.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.84,0:17:47.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.96,0:17:51.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ping'er can't fulfill his promise
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.24,0:17:53.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,to accompany you through life forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.76,0:17:59.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ping'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.88,0:18:00.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,drink your medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.80,0:18:05.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:07.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,the medicine is very bitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.76,0:18:08.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.12,0:18:09.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,the medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.96,0:18:12.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,is very bitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.84,0:18:44.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.20,0:18:47.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Ping and I made a promise
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.28,0:18:51.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I will accompany him even in the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.48,0:18:54.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.04,0:18:56.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to stay with him !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.64,0:18:59.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:01.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,won't regret it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.88,0:19:06.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.40,0:19:39.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.04,0:19:42.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.12,0:19:45.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ping'er can't fulfill his promise
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.48,0:19:48.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,to accompany you through life forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.80,0:19:51.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:54.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,if I cultivate,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.36,0:19:57.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,my soul will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.92,0:20:00.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is that right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.20,0:20:08.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,After I die,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.60,0:20:11.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,send me to Father's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.68,0:20:14.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,As for you, you will be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.96,0:20:18.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I could choose,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.40,0:20:21.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,and if there is a next life,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.44,0:20:27.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wish to be with Father in a small mountain village secluded from the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.32,0:20:30.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,We would live an ordinary,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:32.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,peaceful life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:36.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.40,0:20:42.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.52,0:21:13.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.04,0:21:16.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,since you won't let me cultivate
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.40,0:21:18.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,then I will become
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.40,0:21:21.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,the supreme ruler among mortals !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:24.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ping'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.32,0:21:27.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,you've grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.16,0:21:39.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}The light in the clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.96,0:21:42.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}pierces through the fog
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.00,0:21:45.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}without looking back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.72,0:21:51.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}There's no need to make a fuss,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.96,0:21:54.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}let time
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.72,0:21:57.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}settle all grudges.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.40,0:22:05.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}I will never forget how burning the tears of this world can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.04,0:22:12.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}Don’t be afraid of gains and losses or the ups and downs of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.52,0:22:17.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}When one has lived through the trials and tribulations of an ordinary life,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.64,0:22:24.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}their heart remains unburdened as they look back on the passing years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.56,0:22:30.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}Looking back, the cycle of karma has always been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.04,0:22:35.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}May you never be consumed by grudges and resentment in this life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.76,0:22:32.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take care,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.64,0:22:34.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.80,0:22:41.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}I know you've seen all the world has to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.00,0:22:41.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spend a lifetime with Ping'er
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:50.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}but you’re still a child in my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.32,0:22:46.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I'll give you Nascent Soul cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.88,0:22:47.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you willing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.76,0:22:54.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I truly cannot understand
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.80,0:22:56.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,why Father refuses to let me cultivate !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.44,0:22:57.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.12,0:22:59.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're not suited for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.72,0:23:03.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,That girl named Qing Yi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.24,0:23:08.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,seems like a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.40,0:23:11.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don’t need you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.24,0:23:15.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,to discipline my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.96,0:23:18.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}Everything in this world
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.84,0:23:21.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}is born homeless
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:24.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}like the echoes of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.56,0:23:30.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}But the scent of the locust tree
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.80,0:23:33.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}brings back memories of home
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.48,0:23:36.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}as if you were right by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.72,0:23:44.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}Don’t ask me if it was fate or a trial, it will be impossible to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.89,0:23:46.72,Grave,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(960,357)}Sun\NTai's\NGrave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.96,0:23:51.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}Don't ask me how long it will take for us to meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.16,0:23:47.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.84,0:23:49.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will spend my life
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.36,0:23:51.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,accompanying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.40,0:23:53.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even in death.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.36,0:23:56.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}How can our relation be measured\Nby the number of days and nights we spent together ?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.44,0:24:02.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}Let’s simply keep each other in our thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.56,0:24:08.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}Looking back at the past, I have come to see through it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.72,0:24:15.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}But upon my return, I still say I have no regrets for having poured out my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.92,0:24:20.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}There’s no need to dwell on the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.68,0:24:29.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}it's enough that this memory remains in my heart for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.96,0:24:32.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ping'er can't lie to Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.68,0:24:36.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't make Dad sad !
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.60,0:24:47.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.68,0:24:50.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The medicine is very bitter...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.08,0:24:55.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let dust return to dust,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.76,0:25:00.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}Looking back at the past, I have come to see through it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.88,0:24:57.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,let dirt return to dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.20,0:25:00.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Above the Life and Death reincarnation cycle
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.68,0:25:03.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,lies the elusive karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.92,0:25:06.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}But upon my return, I still say I have no regrets for having poured out my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.48,0:25:06.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The resentment you bear,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.04,0:25:11.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}There’s no need to dwell on the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.08,0:25:08.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,born from bloodshed,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.12,0:25:11.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,must also be dissolved in the mortal world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.88,0:25:20.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}it's enough that this memory remains in my heart for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.92,0:25:13.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,This time,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.44,0:25:15.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will grant you a new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.76,0:25:19.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enter this world of human existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.00,0:25:21.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,to truly live
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.60,0:25:23.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,the life you deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.20,0:25:56.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Above Life and Death
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.84,0:25:58.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,there is...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.36,0:26:02.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Karma.
